							"signature": "or(_ other: Boolean) -> Boolean",
							"summary": "Answers the logical disjunction: `true` when either Boolean is `true`.\n\nBoth sides are evaluated, as they are for `and`. Where the other side is expensive, write `define { as true if flag as other otherwise }`.",
